Instance dispatch adds `GetPhysicalDeviceImageFormatProperties`. Device dispatch adds `CreateImage`, `DestroyImage`, `GetImageMemoryRequirements`, `BindImageMemory`, `CreateImageView`, `DestroyImageView`, `CreateRenderPass`, `DestroyRenderPass`, `CreateFramebuffer`, `DestroyFramebuffer`, `CmdClearColorImage`, `CmdClearDepthStencilImage`, `CmdCopyBufferToImage`, `CmdCopyImageToBuffer`, `CmdBeginRenderPass`, and `CmdEndRenderPass`. Missing required entry points fail device or instance initialization with existing rollback. The existing instance parent and cached physical-device handle supply configuration queries during Device.create_image.

