The accepted layout set is UNDEFINED, GENERAL, COLOR_ATTACHMENT_OPTIMAL, DEPTH_STENCIL_ATTACHMENT_OPTIMAL, DEPTH_STENCIL_READ_ONLY_OPTIMAL, SHADER_READ_ONLY_OPTIMAL, TRANSFER_SRC_OPTIMAL, and TRANSFER_DST_OPTIMAL. No presentation or PREINITIALIZED layout is accepted.

