### Tagged command transitions

Keep the existing command phase and submission union authoritative. Add a payload valid only for Recording.

```c
typedef enum { BV_OUTSIDE, BV_INSIDE } BvRenderTag;
typedef struct {
  BvRenderTag tag;
  union { struct { BvRow *framebuffer; } inside; } data;
} BvRenderScope;

/* The existing BvCommand union gains this alternative. */
struct { BvRenderScope scope; } recording;
```

The current framebuffer pointer describes the active recording scope. Its keepalive is the graph edge, not a separate ownership mechanism. Pending and Uncertain continue to carry only their existing fence association. There is no image-specific pending list.

| Input state and operation | Dispatch and resulting state |
| --- | --- |
| Initial + begin | Successful Vulkan begin enters Recording/Outside. Driver failure enters Invalid. |
"}

